Error [E0083]: `(` opened on line 2 is never closed
  --> tests/ui/unclosed_paren_call.jet:2:10
    |
  2 |     print("hello"
    |          ^
  --> tests/ui/unclosed_paren_call.jet:2:18
    |
  2 |     print("hello"
    |                  ^ the end of the line comes before the closing `)`
 Why: Every `(` needs a matching `)`, but the end of the line came first
 Fix: Add `)` where the call ends
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0083
